abstract: >-
  Code, frozen protocol, prompts, specifications, raw model outputs, ground-truth and
  rating workbooks, de-identified ratings, and the analysis script and outputs for the
  expanded evaluation of the AI-Assisted Test Scope Recommender (ATSR): three prompt
  conditions, three model families, three runs, 18 specifications, and three blinded
  raters under protocol ATSR-SREP-R2-v1.0.
